# Parameters that need to be passed to MyFit1line
# Columns
# 1: Name of the parameter
# 2: Value
# 3: Explanation
myfilecube,Haro11_ec_all.rc.fits,MUSEcube
mypath,/home/polaris/nitrogen_haro11/data/,path where the cube is located
myblue,6550,Blue limit for the range to be fitted
myred,6570,Red limit for the range to be fitted
myz,0.00,Assumed systemic velocity
mypathNF,/home/polaris/nitrogen_haro11/data/narrowFilterMaps/,Path for images with NF
mypathout,/home/polaris/nitrogen_haro11/data/1dFits/Ha/,File where I save the fits
minsig,0.80,minimum line width
maxsig,1.40,maximum line width
minlam,-3.0,bluest allowed offset
maxlam,+3.0,reddest allowed offset
myslope,-0.01,assumed slope for the local continuum
mylcen,6562.77,CentralWavelength
mylinename,Ha,Linename
raiz,Ha,root name for the directories and files for slope and intercept
myimaNF,NFM_Ha.fits,Image with NF as initial conditions
myscale,0.3,scaling for the NF image of reference
fmin,1.E1,minimum flux for the line
fmax,5.E5,maximum flux for the line
